# Testing standard

Read [`skills/testing-standard/SKILL.md`](../skills/testing-standard/SKILL.md) before adding tests.

- Run: `cd backend && bash scripts/run-tests.sh` — not `mops test` or `npm test`
- Mirror `src/` layout under `testing/`; suffix `.test.mo`
- Register every new suite in `scripts/run-tests.sh`
- Assert values + `#err` paths; use two principals for multi-user features
- New migration → `testing/upgrade/<Name>.test.mo`
